{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpggG72C8tvmyAg8U7x2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Decision: DR-9113\n\n## Analysis\n\n### 1. The Request\n- **Request ID:** DR-9113\n- **Customer (CRM):** CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing)\n- **Customer (ERP):** C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings) — names match between systems\n- **Product:** NS-500 Industrial Controller\n- **Requested discount:** 15.0% of $250,000 list price = $37,500\n- **Requested by:** Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive\n- **Request date:** 2027-02-01\n- **Basis:** Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\n\n### 2. Active Contract\nThe Acme Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025) is active on 2027-02-01:\n- Effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n- Covers NS-500 Industrial Controller and other products\n- Status: **Active**\n\n### 3. Pricing Exception\nException EXC-ACME-NS500-15 covers this product and date:\n- Applies to NS-500 only\n- Maximum eligible discount: **15%**\n- Effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n- Request date 2027-02-01 is within scope\n- Status: **Covers this request**\n\n### 4. Policy in Effect: 2027\nFrom Pricing Policy 2027 (effective 2027-01-01 to 2027-12-31):\n\n| Role | Authority |\n|---|---|\n| Enterprise Account Executives | ≤5% |\n| VP Sales | >5% and ≤12% |\n| Chief Revenue Officer | >12% |\n\n### 5. Requestor's Authority\n- **Sarah Chen:** Enterprise Account Executive\n- **Authority under 2027 policy:** up to 5%\n- **Requested discount:** 15%\n- **Authorized:** No — exceeds her authority\n\n### 6. Required Approver\nDiscount of 15% exceeds 12%, therefore:\n- **Required role:** Chief Revenue Officer\n- **Holder:** David Morgan (david.morgan@northstar.example)\n\n### 7. Commercial Eligibility\nThe pricing exception establishes that Acme is eligible for up to 15% discount on the NS-500 on this date. The requested discount of 15% is **at the maximum** of the exception's scope.\n\n- **Status:** Eligible\n- **Maximum discount under exception:** 15%\n- **Does not exceed eligibility:** Yes\n\n### 8. Decision\n\nEligibility is established by the pricing exception. However, the requested discount (15%) exceeds Sarah Chen's approval authority (5% for Enterprise Account Executives under the 2027 policy). \n\nThe Chief Revenue Officer must approve, because this is a 15% discount and the 2027 policy requires Chief Revenue Officer approval for any discount exceeding 12%.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9113\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048, ERP C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"date\": \"2027-02-01\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15, Schedule B to Acme Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2027\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"5%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Chief Revenue Officer\",\n    \"approver\": \"David Morgan (david.morgan@northstar.example)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Acme Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 (active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (15% max for NS-500, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Pricing Policy 2027 (CRO approval required for discounts >12%)\",\n    \"CRM account CRM-2048: Acme Manufacturing, Strategic tier\",\n    \"Product NS-500: list price $250,000\",\n    \"Organization chart: Sarah Chen = Enterprise Account Executive; David Morgan = Chief Revenue Officer\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens"